            "title": "“准取”不是想回就回"
          }
        },
        "chapter_card_fields": [
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29083,
                29246
              ],
              "lines": [
                717,
                719
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "464493c8e77fcf3e01f53a96492dd235548be95f574e7651acdcdcbfe9e74ec1"
            },
            "name": "最强处",
            "number": 2,
            "text": "**2｜最强处**  \n准取不是自由回府；雪地、湿鞋、旧府物件重新认领；旧单从取物自然生出；麝月钥匙“今日没什么用”。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29246,
                29361
              ],
              "lines": [
                720,
                722
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "c09af1619f9c59637d33a14642909c4ceba9d16cdebd6971e5413238b7a40a81"
            },
            "name": "最薄处",
            "number": 3,
            "text": "**3｜最薄处**  \n旧府文化物的“失主化”可加一两笔；准入规则与登记人再清楚一点。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29361,
                29489
              ],
              "lines": [
                723,
                725
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "6cc97a13cccbe3c1ca4ba6a3367927bf54834a3c460b0ed70af9841e0f1b3730"
            },
            "name": "缺失情节",
            "number": 4,
            "text": "**4｜缺失情节**  \n91-S1凭名目准取；S2物分可取/不可取/无人要；S3拾物先登记；S4旧单带到宝玉。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29910,
                29960
              ],
              "lines": [
                741,
                743
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
              "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
              "text_sha256": "5cccc9256b3b4906dc6d4e10575ab5f420404f5e7754882c2735ffa822519aec"
            },
            "name": "职业",
            "number": 10,
            "text": "**10｜职业**  \n准取看守、登记书办。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
              "byte_range": [
                29960,
                30094
              ],
              "lines": [
                744,
                746
              ],
              "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
